      <uighur>degeremdegülkü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>дээрэмдүүлэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>DEGEREMDEGYL-</transcript>
      <definition>[v. caus. of degeremde-] To be robbed or plundered; to allow oneself to be robbed;</definition>
      <page>244</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠺᠠᠷᠠᠮᠳᠠᠺᠥᠯᠦᠭᠰᠡᠨ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>--ygsen kymyn</transcript>
          <definition> Victim of a robbery.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
